  "description": "Cha Do-Won, a genius national team member who knew nothing but shooting. From the very day he reunited with his first love, Seo Yi-Jeong, whom he hadn’t seen in nine years, he found himself having wet dreams about him... \n\nThe Yi-Jeong he met in his dreams was sensual and candid. But fearing he might never make the national team if things continued this way, Do-Won decided to seek out Yi-Jeong, whom he had been avoiding. \n\n *“Hyung, why did you kiss me?”\n\n“I did it because I want to sleep with you.”*\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
